From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paolo Pisati <paolo.pisati@canonical.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 10:21:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] UBUNTU: SAUCE: Revert "ceph: move mdsmap.h to fs/ceph/"

This reverts commit b9c150ca6d9f.

This patch was retired from the stonking linux 7.2 kernel by its owner
and recorded as obsolete in Changes.md ("UBUNTU: Changes.md: Drop more
obsolete sauce", f3f1bdc6d342 on stonking master-next). Drop it here as
well, so that 7.3 linux does not bring back a patch 7.2 no longer carries.

Signed-off-by: Paolo Pisati <paolo.pisati@canonical.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00250
Ledger-Origin: ubuntu@a58c99c1045d61f4559de46d3b21f9dfb68a22f6
---
 fs/ceph/mdsmap.c | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/fs/ceph/mdsmap.c b/fs/ceph/mdsmap.c
index a529ba8766fa..8e2937e4e562 100644
--- a/fs/ceph/mdsmap.c
+++ b/fs/ceph/mdsmap.c
@@ -14,7 +14,6 @@
 #include "mdsmap.h"
 #include "mds_client.h"
 #include "super.h"
-#include "mdsmap.h"
 
 #define CEPH_MDS_IS_READY(i, ignore_laggy) \
 	(m->m_info[i].state > 0 && (ignore_laggy ? true : !m->m_info[i].laggy))
